l+Sinsa+Gangnam+Seoul' },\n    { name:'Hair Tattoo Appointment 💇', lat:37.5220, lng:127.0279, c:'#C62828', url:'https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=hair+tattoo+salon+Gangnam+Seoul' },\n    { name:'Gebang Sikdang 🦀 (Soy Crab)', lat:37.5180, lng:127.0275, c:'#43A047', url:'https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Gebang+Sikdang+Seoul' },\n    { name:'Sappun Shoes 👟', lat:37.5180, lng:127.0200, c:'#EC407A', url:'https://share.google/1W5iNuG4JvJBuEQan' },\n  ];\n  window.pageMap = map; window.pageMarkers = [];\n  pts.forEach(function(p) {\n    var m = L.marker([p.lat, p.lng], { icon: p.hotel ? hotelDot() : dot(p.c) }).addTo(map);\n    var html = '<b>' + p.name + '</b>';\n    if (p.url) html += '<br><a href=\"' + p.url + '\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Open in Maps →</a>';\n    m.bindPopup(html);\n    window.pageMarkers.push({ marker: m, lat: p.lat, lng: p.lng });\n  });\n})();\n</script>\n```\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"section-header\">Morning</div>\n\n<div class=\"event-card meal\" style=\"border-color:#F9A825;background:#FFFDE7\" data-dt=\"2026-07-28T07:00\" data-lat=\"37.5572\" data-lng=\"126.9680\">\n  <div class=\"event-time\">07:00</div>\n  <div class=\"event-body\">\n    <div class=\"event-tags\"><span class=\"tag note\">🍳 Breakfast</span></div>\n    <div class=\"event-name\">Breakfast Buffet · CAFE (B1F) · Shilla Stay</div>\n    <div class=\"event-notes\">Weekday hours: <strong>06:30–09:30</strong> · ₩23,000/adult · COVA coffee, croissants, Korean &amp; Western hot dishes. Arrive by <strong>09:00</strong> at the latest — staff strictly enforce closing time.</div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"event-card morning\" data-dt=\"2026-07-28T09:30\" data-lat=\"37.5222\" data-lng=\"127.0277\">\n  <div class=\"event-time\">09:30</div>\n  <div class=\"event-body\">\n    <div class=\"event-tags\"><span class=\"tag booked\">BOOKED ✓</span><span class=\"tag activity\">🎨 Activity</span></div>\n    <div class=\"event-name\">VIC Lab — Perso