ttps://map.naver.com/p/search/게방식당\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link naver-link\">🗺 Naver</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"event-card meal\" data-dt=\"2026-07-28T19:30\">\n  <div class=\"event-time\">Alt</div>\n  <div class=\"event-body\">\n    <div class=\"event-tags\"><span class=\"tag meal\">🍗 Alt Dinner</span></div>\n    <div class=\"event-name\">Muguok — MUST TRY!</div>\n    <div class=\"event-notes\">\n      <ul>\n        <li>Samgyetang (삼계탕) — ginseng chicken soup</li>\n        <li>Personal ginseng chicken set recommended</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"event-links\">\n      <a href=\"https://share.google/UOPBKDA8VC4znQa1q\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link\">📍 Muguok</a>\n      <a href=\"https://map.naver.com/p/search/무국삼계탕+서울\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link naver-link\">🗺 Naver</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"section-header\">Evening (Optional)</div>\n\n<div class=\"event-card evening\" data-dt=\"2026-07-28T21:00\">\n  <div class=\"event-time\">21:00</div>\n  <div class=\"event-body\">\n    <div class=\"event-tags\"><span class=\"tag tbd\">TBD</span><span class=\"tag activity\">🎬 Optional</span></div>\n    <div class=\"event-name\">Luxury Cinema Experience</div>\n    <div class=\"event-notes\">Premium cinema screening — book in advance. CGV Yongsan 4DX or Lotte Cinema Signatur are popular picks.</div>\n    <div class=\"event-links\">\n      <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=CGV+luxury+cinema+Seoul\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link\">📍 Cinemas</a>\n      <a href=\"https://map.naver.com/p/search/CGV+프리미엄+서울\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link naver-link\">🗺 Naver</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"note-box\"><strong>Breakfast included</strong> at hotel. · Today's big spend: colour analysis + hair + crab dinner — budget accordingly.</div>\n```\n"},"formats":{"html":{"identifier":{"display-name":"HTML","target-format":"h